      <title>超越规模：Qwen3-Next如何重新定义大模型的“高效智能”边界</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/qwen3-next-20250912194005602-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 12 Sep 2025 19:40:05 +0800</pubDate>
